# /public/build is deliberately NOT ignored. Hostinger shared hosting has no
# Node runtime, so compiled assets are built locally and shipped with the code.

# Logos uploaded through Settings are per-install; the committed drop-in file
# at public/Logo.png ships with the code so a fresh clone is complete.
